OL,3,AHeat pumps: How much heat does your
OL,4,Ahome really need?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFloorplans. Air duct diagrams. Heat
OL,7,Fpump specifications. Most people in the
OL,8,Fmarket for a new heating system
OL,9,Fprobably don't want to think about this
OL,10,Flevel of detail.
OL,12,FBut, perhaps surprisingly, some do want
OL,13,Fto think about those things. In extreme
OL,14,Fdepth.
OL,16,FEvery day, roughly 150 new users sign
OL,17,Fup to an app called Cool Calc, which
OL,18,Fworks out the heat requirements of
OL,19,Fproperties in the US.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
